WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:05.630
I kept drawing rainbow colours over and over

00:00.300 --> 00:05.630
hitasura kaiteta niji no iro

00:05.630 --> 00:10.130
Seven colours are not enough

00:05.630 --> 00:10.130
mou nanairo ja tarinai kara

00:10.130 --> 00:15.800
Everyday leaps over the "usual" and enters a new chapter

00:10.130 --> 00:13.130
mainichi wa sude ni itsumo wo

00:13.130 --> 00:15.800
tobikoete shinshou nano sa

00:15.800 --> 00:21.800
The story is going beyond

00:15.800 --> 00:21.800
monogatari wa haruka kanata e

00:25.970 --> 00:31.300
The bell toll in my heart

00:25.970 --> 00:31.300
kokoro de naridasu kane no ne ga

00:31.300 --> 00:35.630
is getting louder bit by bit

00:31.300 --> 00:35.630
sukoshi zutsu ookiku natte yuku

00:35.630 --> 00:39.130
Believe in the excitement

00:35.630 --> 00:39.130
sono takanari wo shinjite

00:39.130 --> 00:41.630
And take one step forward

00:39.130 --> 00:41.630
ippo wo fumidaseta nara

00:41.630 --> 00:48.960
It'll give me more power than I ever imagined

00:41.630 --> 00:48.960
souzou ijouno chikara ni kawatteru yo

00:47.300 --> 00:49.960
Can't be for sure

00:47.300 --> 00:49.960
zettai nante nai

00:48.960 --> 00:51.630
Nothing

00:48.960 --> 00:51.630
nanimo

00:49.960 --> 00:52.630
There's no guarantee

00:49.960 --> 00:52.630
kakushin wa dekinai

00:51.630 --> 00:54.300
No one

00:51.630 --> 00:54.300
daremo

00:52.630 --> 00:55.300
But I won't give up

00:52.630 --> 00:55.300
demo akiramenai

00:54.300 --> 00:56.960
That's why

00:54.300 --> 00:56.960
dakara

00:55.300 --> 00:57.460
I can still move forward

00:55.300 --> 00:57.460
susundeku koto ga

00:57.290 --> 00:58.800
I can still move forward

00:57.290 --> 00:58.800
dekiru yo

00:58.800 --> 01:04.630
Because there's magic right in here

00:58.800 --> 01:04.630
koko ni wa mahou ga aru kara

01:04.630 --> 01:10.960
It started to be brighter than the stars

01:04.630 --> 01:10.960
datte hoshi yori kagayaki dashita no ni

01:10.960 --> 01:15.630
I can't stop now

01:10.960 --> 01:15.630
tachidomareru hazu mo nai kara

01:15.630 --> 01:21.300
It entered into a new era

01:15.630 --> 01:21.300
jidai wa tsui ni atarashii makuake wo mukaeta no sa

01:21.300 --> 01:25.630
Placing this overflowing feelings into this gem

01:21.300 --> 01:25.630
afureta omoi wo kiseki ni komete

01:25.630 --> 01:29.300
And go beyond the future

01:25.630 --> 01:29.300
saki no hou e

01:35.750 --> 01:37.330
Tia-chan!

01:57.120 --> 01:58.030
Yes!

01:58.030 --> 01:59.120
We did it!

02:24.160 --> 02:25.290
Correct!

02:27.830 --> 02:28.870
Heck yeah!

02:32.330 --> 02:34.660
Too bad.

02:34.660 --> 02:35.830
Next!

02:42.330 --> 02:43.370
Hup!

02:48.120 --> 02:49.540
Not bad!

02:53.040 --> 02:54.790
I think things
might just work out.

02:54.790 --> 02:57.500
Yeah. I'm starting
to see some hope.

02:57.500 --> 03:00.950
At this rate, we might be
able to avoid expulsion.

03:00.950 --> 03:02.500
It's all thanks to me, the ace!

03:02.500 --> 03:05.540
You really are doing amazing
this term, Lavie-san.

03:05.540 --> 03:07.660
Yay! Praise me more!

03:07.660 --> 03:10.160
You might finally be average now.

03:11.330 --> 03:13.540
That's not a compliment, is it?

03:13.540 --> 03:16.040
This is all thanks to our hard work.

03:16.040 --> 03:17.700
Do you have a moment?

03:17.700 --> 03:18.700
Coco.

03:18.700 --> 03:20.660
Delivery time.

03:20.660 --> 03:22.950
I have two notifications for you.

03:22.950 --> 03:26.540
Is your group in charge
of deliveries this week, Coco-san?

03:26.540 --> 03:29.620
Yup. We received a summons.

03:29.620 --> 03:31.250
Lucky...

03:31.250 --> 03:35.700
Lily's complaining, saying, "This is too lame."

03:35.700 --> 03:38.040
Sounds like someone I know.

03:38.040 --> 03:39.790
Hmm?

03:39.790 --> 03:41.000
Well, see you later.

03:41.000 --> 03:43.120
Sure. Thank you.

03:43.120 --> 03:44.700
Yes!

03:44.700 --> 03:47.700
"To reward you for your assistance in
investigating the supernatural phenomena,

03:47.700 --> 03:50.410
your group has been awarded ten points."

03:50.410 --> 03:51.360
Yes!

03:51.360 --> 03:53.540
We're finally seeing the light.

03:53.540 --> 03:55.160
What's the other one?

03:55.160 --> 03:58.200
This one's... from the director.

03:58.200 --> 04:00.870
I can't believe we got
a notification from her personally!

04:00.870 --> 04:03.950
Maybe we're getting a bonus
for all our hard work!

04:03.950 --> 04:06.290
Calm down, calm down...

04:06.290 --> 04:08.000
Let's see...

04:08.000 --> 04:10.830
"Because you took the map
for the investigation"...

04:13.200 --> 04:17.950
..."from the director's office
without permission

04:17.950 --> 04:20.410
you are being deducted 70 points."

04:26.330 --> 04:27.500
Lavie...

04:29.250 --> 04:30.950
You Silly Rabbit!

04:30.950 --> 04:33.580
What possessed you
to take it without permission?!

04:33.580 --> 04:36.790
But... But... I left a note saying
we were gonna borrow it!

04:36.790 --> 04:39.660
The director wasn't there so
what was I supposed to do?!

04:40.870 --> 04:42.290
Honestly!

05:01.120 --> 05:02.750
Sorry...

05:02.750 --> 05:04.500
Forget about that.

05:04.500 --> 05:08.540
You went to get that map for our sake.

05:08.540 --> 05:12.290
Yes. I probably would've done the same.

05:12.290 --> 05:15.250
Tia-chan... Rose-chan...

05:15.250 --> 05:20.200
Well, it was because of that map that
we got to help out with that investigation.

05:20.200 --> 05:21.500
Ashley...

05:21.500 --> 05:24.330
Though we lost points because of it.

05:26.250 --> 05:29.000
Well, Silly Rabbit's always
just going to be a Silly Rabbit.

05:29.000 --> 05:30.540
What do we do now?

05:30.540 --> 05:32.700
I mean...

05:32.700 --> 05:36.700
Even if we received all of
the remaining points this term...

05:38.790 --> 05:40.750
Don't worry!

05:40.750 --> 05:42.410
Tia...

05:42.410 --> 05:46.700
We still have some time,
so it's too early to give up!

05:48.120 --> 05:49.870
That's true.

05:49.870 --> 05:52.040
You said it, Tia-chan!

05:52.040 --> 05:55.870
Let's all do our best to become
the best witches we can be!

05:55.870 --> 05:57.080
Yeah!

05:57.080 --> 06:00.290
At this rate, my sister's going to laugh at me.

06:00.290 --> 06:02.790
Your sister?

06:02.790 --> 06:05.500
My older sister was a witch.

06:05.500 --> 06:07.660
She was just so cool and wonderful.

06:07.660 --> 06:10.750
I want to be just like her.

06:10.750 --> 06:14.120
Huh, I never knew that about you, Tia-chan.

06:14.120 --> 06:17.660
She must be an amazing witch
if she's your sister, Tiara-san.

06:17.660 --> 06:18.880
Ueh?

06:18.880 --> 06:21.450
Uh... Yeah.

06:21.450 --> 06:25.620
Okay, everyone.
Let's stop being depressed and eat!

06:25.620 --> 06:26.660
Yeah!

06:26.660 --> 06:30.160
A healthy mind starts with a healthy meal.

06:30.160 --> 06:32.200
We can think later.

06:32.200 --> 06:35.160
Yeah. I'm sure we can figure something out!

06:36.370 --> 06:40.160
Or so I said, but... What should we do?

06:44.120 --> 06:46.910
Seriously... What are you even doing?

06:46.910 --> 06:48.450
Emilia...

06:48.450 --> 06:50.870
I heard what's going on. Sounds rough.

06:52.370 --> 06:53.700
Yeah...

06:53.700 --> 06:56.410
Well, uh... If something's troubling you,

06:56.410 --> 06:59.080
I guess I wouldn't mind hearing you out.

06:59.080 --> 07:00.160
Huh?

07:00.160 --> 07:01.830
I'm saying...

07:04.080 --> 07:08.450
You want Tiara-san to feel better,
don't you, Emilia-san?

07:08.450 --> 07:11.790
Wha— Of course not! I was just...

07:14.000 --> 07:16.500
You're not fooling anyone.

07:16.500 --> 07:23.160
I know <i>everything </i>about you, Emilia-san.

07:23.160 --> 07:25.370
Emilia.

07:25.370 --> 07:26.700
Thank you.

07:28.040 --> 07:31.330
Wh-What are you thanking me for?!
I told you that's not it!

07:31.330 --> 07:34.250
My, my. You need to be
more honest with yourself.

07:36.200 --> 07:37.660
Mary-san agreed?

07:37.660 --> 07:41.120
Yeah. She suddenly got motivated.

07:41.120 --> 07:42.830
That's wonderful.

07:42.830 --> 07:45.830
Looks like that trip to
the mountains did us some good.

07:45.830 --> 07:50.000
Sugar Pockets may end up
being like Ray someday.

07:50.000 --> 07:54.000
Yeah, that's aiming a bit high there.

07:54.000 --> 07:56.250
I'm sure you can do it, Rara-chan.

07:56.250 --> 07:57.870
You think so?

07:56.590 --> 07:59.910
Were those two always that close?

07:59.910 --> 08:02.580
Apparently, they hit it off.

08:02.580 --> 08:05.750
It's rare to see Lynette talking that much.

08:06.500 --> 08:08.790
Ratura-chan!

08:08.790 --> 08:11.200
We need to practice one more time!

08:11.200 --> 08:13.620
And nothing beats the bath right after!

08:13.620 --> 08:15.450
Okay.

08:15.450 --> 08:17.910
She's been like that for a while.

08:17.910 --> 08:20.330
That's very promising.

08:20.330 --> 08:23.000
Make sure you come see us, Lynette!

08:23.000 --> 08:25.200
Yes, of course!

08:32.950 --> 08:35.790
Okay, everyone. Let's hurry!

08:35.790 --> 08:37.750
You're going to trip if you hurry like that.

08:37.750 --> 08:41.750
Why do they always have Orchestras
in different locations every time?

08:41.750 --> 08:45.120
Because they can't cover
the whole city at once.

08:45.120 --> 08:49.040
They're maintaining a balance
by gathering mana district by district.

08:49.040 --> 08:52.950
If they keep performing in the same spot,
everything becomes unbalanced.

08:52.950 --> 08:55.500
Oh, that's why...

08:55.500 --> 08:57.660
That's sort of amazing.

08:57.660 --> 09:01.160
Even that light is being
supported by everyone's songs

09:01.160 --> 09:04.750
and help from everyone in the city.

09:04.750 --> 09:05.950
Yeah...

09:05.950 --> 09:08.200
Ray was even more amazing!

09:08.200 --> 09:09.290
Huh?

09:09.290 --> 09:11.950
Ray is the unit that Eliza-sama was in.

09:11.950 --> 09:14.500
Wow, you actually know what
you're talking about for once.

09:14.500 --> 09:16.120
Heh.

09:16.120 --> 09:17.120
Huh?

09:17.480 --> 09:20.750
Ray was able to make their songs carry magic!

09:20.750 --> 09:25.500
And by doing so, they were able
to amplify their magic even more.

09:25.500 --> 09:27.790
Wow, you can do that...?

09:27.790 --> 09:30.790
Ray's the only unit that
managed to pull that off,

09:30.790 --> 09:34.580
though Yue and the rest
of supernova's getting close.

09:34.580 --> 09:36.620
Yue-san and the rest of supernova...

09:44.790 --> 09:46.370
Rara-chan!

09:48.410 --> 09:49.660
Go on, Mary.

09:50.660 --> 09:53.370
Um... I'm Maryberry.

09:53.370 --> 09:56.500
I'm still new at this,
but thank you for having me!

10:01.750 --> 10:02.700
And now...

10:02.700 --> 10:04.330
...Sugar Pockets is gonna...

10:04.330 --> 10:07.040
...steal all of your hearts!

10:09.640 --> 10:12.280
kokoro wa caramelized

10:09.640 --> 10:12.280
Your heart is caramelized

10:12.280 --> 10:13.860
only you

10:12.280 --> 10:13.860
Only you

10:14.280 --> 10:17.240
sweet and bitter heart

10:14.280 --> 10:17.240
Sweet and bitter heart

10:19.780 --> 10:24.850
lovely baby

10:19.780 --> 10:24.850
fukigen ni mukureta kao no lovely baby

10:19.780 --> 10:24.850
In a bad mood, the pouting face of a lovely baby

10:25.270 --> 10:26.750
paya, paya

10:25.270 --> 10:26.750
Paya, paya

10:26.750 --> 10:31.610
lonely

10:26.750 --> 10:31.610
ohayou no hagu mo kawasarete lonely

10:26.750 --> 10:31.610
In the mornings, avoiding the hugs-so lonely

10:32.030 --> 10:33.510
paya, paya

10:33.510 --> 10:38.370
you said

10:33.510 --> 10:38.370
doshitano soppo mui tama made you said

10:33.510 --> 10:38.370
What's wrong? You kept facing the other way, you said

10:38.790 --> 10:40.060
nanikana

10:38.790 --> 10:40.060
What is it?

10:40.060 --> 10:43.650
anata no sei de moyamoya suruno

10:40.060 --> 10:43.650
It's your fault, so I won't tell you

10:43.650 --> 10:46.400
riyuu wa oshienai!

10:43.650 --> 10:46.400
why I'm feeling depressed!

10:46.400 --> 10:50.200
komara sarechau no mo warukunai yo

10:46.400 --> 10:50.200
It's not that bad to be in a fix

10:48.290 --> 10:49.290
Huh?

10:49.290 --> 10:51.290
Did that tower change colours?

10:50.200 --> 10:53.580
kazaranai kimi wo shiritainda

10:50.200 --> 10:53.580
I want to get to know the unadorned you

10:51.290 --> 10:52.910
That's the Metrics Tower.

10:52.910 --> 10:56.290
It changes colour depending on
how much mana it fills up with.

10:53.580 --> 10:57.590
itsuka mitsuketa kafe ni ikou yo

10:53.580 --> 10:57.590
Let's go to the cafe that we found that time

10:56.290 --> 10:57.370
Huh...

10:57.590 --> 11:00.340
sonna ni sunenai de

10:57.590 --> 11:00.340
so don't keep holding yourself back

11:00.340 --> 11:04.350
amaku kogareta kokoro tsutsukeba

11:00.340 --> 11:04.350
If you poke at your sweetly-in-love heart

11:04.350 --> 11:07.520
paripari to hibiwarete

11:04.350 --> 11:07.520
It will crisply crumble

11:07.520 --> 11:10.900
kowai kurai yawarakai

11:07.520 --> 11:10.900
It's scarily soft and squishy

11:10.900 --> 11:14.180
sunao na omoi ga afuredasu

11:10.900 --> 11:14.180
and honest feelings are overflowing

11:14.180 --> 11:17.870
kimi ga kureru kotoba yashigusa

11:14.180 --> 11:17.870
All the words and gestures that you express to me

11:16.120 --> 11:17.910
They're so sparkly.

11:17.870 --> 11:21.040
subete ga daisuki dakara

11:17.870 --> 11:21.040
I love them all

11:17.910 --> 11:19.240
Yes.

11:19.950 --> 11:22.000
Couldn't we do that, too?

11:21.040 --> 11:24.630
dekirudake uketometainda

11:21.040 --> 11:24.630
I want to take it in as much as I can

11:22.000 --> 11:22.850
Huh?

11:22.850 --> 11:24.080
Tia-chan?

11:24.080 --> 11:26.950
You can get points
doing an Orchestra, right?

11:24.630 --> 11:26.750
itsumo soba ni ite

11:24.630 --> 11:26.750
being always by your side

11:26.950 --> 11:29.040
Yes, but...

11:27.380 --> 11:30.020
wagamama caramelized

11:27.380 --> 11:30.020
I'm selfishly caramelized

11:29.040 --> 11:32.250
You're such a kidder. I mean...

11:30.020 --> 11:31.480
only you

11:30.020 --> 11:31.480
Only you

11:32.030 --> 11:34.990
sweet and bitter heart

11:32.030 --> 11:34.990
Sweet and bitter heart

11:32.250 --> 11:36.580
Can you actually picture us
standing up there?

11:41.160 --> 11:43.450
Nope, not happening. No way, José.

11:44.750 --> 11:46.250
I guess you're right.

11:53.580 --> 11:54.950
I did some calculations.

11:56.160 --> 11:59.080
The most you can get from completely filling
the tower with mana is 80 points.

11:59.080 --> 12:02.700
If we can get it to 72%, we get 57 points.

12:02.700 --> 12:06.160
If we add the points from our remaining classes,

12:06.160 --> 12:08.700
we'll just barely escape failing.

12:08.700 --> 12:10.330
What are you talking about?

12:10.330 --> 12:13.450
They're wondering if we
should put on an Orchestra...

12:13.450 --> 12:14.790
Uehhh?!

12:14.790 --> 12:17.500
Not to mention, 72%?

12:17.500 --> 12:21.160
I'm pretty sure the tower turns yellow at 70%.

12:21.160 --> 12:23.290
And yellow means...

12:23.290 --> 12:26.410
We'll have to surpass Sugar Pockets'
performance yesterday.

12:26.410 --> 12:30.160
Even an ace has things that she can't pull off.

12:30.160 --> 12:32.450
Yeah, I don't think we can...

12:32.450 --> 12:34.750
Do you all want to be expelled?

12:35.660 --> 12:37.330
Well...

12:37.330 --> 12:40.000
I know it seems impossible.

12:40.000 --> 12:44.200
But I want to take the chance
if there's even the slightest possibility.

12:44.200 --> 12:48.330
I don't want to just sit here
and do nothing. Not to mention...

12:48.330 --> 12:51.870
I sort of want to sing now, too.

12:54.580 --> 12:59.580
Not just Sugar Pockets, but IV KLORE,
and Konohana wa Otome...

12:59.580 --> 13:01.790
And supernova...

13:01.790 --> 13:07.040
They're all shining
when they're doing their Orchestra.

13:07.040 --> 13:10.250
They inspired me.

13:10.250 --> 13:14.660
It's not just about the points. I want to sing.

13:14.660 --> 13:16.120
I really want to sing!

13:20.500 --> 13:22.290
Same here!

13:22.290 --> 13:26.870
I guess... it wouldn't hurt to try,
even knowing we might fail.

13:26.870 --> 13:28.120
Tia.

13:28.120 --> 13:29.290
Let's do our best.

13:31.410 --> 13:34.040
Um, please wait a moment.

13:34.040 --> 13:38.540
There's no way we could
possibly do an Orchestra!

13:38.540 --> 13:41.080
Have no fear! We'll just go out with a bang!

13:41.080 --> 13:42.250
Huh?

13:42.250 --> 13:46.790
My father always said,
"Think of adversity as an opportunity."

13:46.790 --> 13:48.500
Lynette.

13:48.500 --> 13:53.330
You don't have to answer us immediately,
but could you at least think about it?

14:06.040 --> 14:08.000
I see. Sure, why not?

14:08.000 --> 14:10.250
I have no reason to stop you.

14:10.250 --> 14:13.200
Yeah, we're going to do everything we can.

14:13.200 --> 14:15.790
Thanks for cheering me up the other day.

14:15.790 --> 14:19.700
Er, I... That's not why I said that...

14:21.750 --> 14:23.120
Emilia?

14:23.120 --> 14:26.250
It's just you never know when
and where she'll pop up from...

14:28.450 --> 14:31.700
We'll do our best to keep up with IV KLORE!

14:31.700 --> 14:34.580
Well, that's rather bold of you.

14:34.580 --> 14:38.660
I hope you'll come see our Orchestra
if you have a chance.

14:38.660 --> 14:41.750
Well, I guess I might go
see it if I feel like it.

14:41.750 --> 14:44.040
Do your best.

14:44.040 --> 14:45.790
Yeah, we will.

14:53.250 --> 14:54.660
What's the meaning of this?

14:55.910 --> 14:57.330
Yue-san...

14:57.330 --> 14:59.580
You're going to put on an Orchestra?

14:59.580 --> 15:02.040
Yes, we're thinking of—

15:02.040 --> 15:03.540
You can't be serious.

15:03.540 --> 15:06.290
You really think just because
you're Eliza-sama's little sister...

15:06.290 --> 15:07.830
What?!

15:07.830 --> 15:10.000
So you did know.

15:10.000 --> 15:11.620
I had no idea.

15:11.620 --> 15:13.950
So you're Eliza-sama's little sister?

15:13.950 --> 15:15.790
You should model for me
so I can draw you sometime!

15:15.790 --> 15:17.250
Huh? Model?!

15:17.250 --> 15:20.540
Don't worry. It's only scary at first!

15:20.540 --> 15:21.790
But I...

15:21.790 --> 15:23.250
You can totally do it!

15:23.250 --> 15:25.250
Regardless.

15:25.250 --> 15:26.910
I'll never acknowledge you.

15:26.910 --> 15:30.000
Why? We just want to sing like you—

15:30.000 --> 15:32.000
Don't compare me with you.

15:32.000 --> 15:36.250
The reason I sing is so that
our songs can carry our magic

15:36.250 --> 15:38.540
and to protect the people.

15:38.540 --> 15:39.950
And...

15:39.950 --> 15:42.620
We're going to exterminate
every last Magical Monster.

15:44.790 --> 15:47.700
I have much more on the line than you do.

15:50.910 --> 15:52.410
Sorry about that.

15:52.410 --> 15:54.500
Yue-chin's always so serious.

15:56.080 --> 15:59.080
Yue's the princess of LongDu.

15:59.080 --> 16:01.580
Yes, I heard about that.

16:01.580 --> 16:04.290
Oh? Well, aren't you in the know?

16:04.290 --> 16:09.750
A few years back, LongDu was
attacked by Magical Monsters.

16:09.750 --> 16:12.870
Apparently, there were a lot of casualties.

16:12.870 --> 16:15.870
But that's when...

16:15.870 --> 16:18.660
...Eliza-sama and the rest of Ray showed up!

16:18.660 --> 16:22.660
Eliza, Chloe, Angers, Camilla, Yuzuriha...

16:22.660 --> 16:26.700
As Ray, they used their magic and song
to exterminate the Magical Monsters,

16:26.700 --> 16:28.080
and LongDu was saved.

16:28.080 --> 16:30.290
They're basically saviors!

16:30.290 --> 16:33.040
Wait, Chloe...?

16:33.040 --> 16:34.870
Yeah, she's our director.

16:34.870 --> 16:35.910
What?!

16:35.910 --> 16:38.370
Oh, you didn't know?

16:38.370 --> 16:41.790
Director Chloe was a member of Ray?

16:41.790 --> 16:47.040
After peace was restored, Eliza-sama
stayed in LongDu a little while longer.

16:47.040 --> 16:50.500
And the one who she mentored was Yue.

16:50.500 --> 16:52.830
So Yue-san was...

16:52.830 --> 16:55.040
Basically, they're master and pupil.

16:57.790 --> 17:02.620
Fiona-san, Millefeuille-san... Thank you!

17:02.620 --> 17:05.950
I'll try talking to Yue-san more!

17:05.950 --> 17:07.410
Good luck!

17:07.410 --> 17:10.000
She really is a kind person.

17:11.080 --> 17:12.330
Right!

17:23.000 --> 17:24.160
Eliza-sama!

17:25.450 --> 17:26.580
Yue...

17:26.580 --> 17:30.080
Is it true that you're
going back to Waleland?

17:30.080 --> 17:32.160
Yes, it is.

17:32.160 --> 17:33.290
No...

17:34.290 --> 17:36.450
Thank you for everything.

17:36.450 --> 17:41.160
No... I should be thanking you.

17:41.160 --> 17:44.290
But... I wanted to learn more!

17:45.370 --> 17:49.290
Thank you. But I have to go home.

17:49.290 --> 17:52.950
I'm sure that my little sister
has been longing to see me.

17:52.950 --> 17:55.250
Little sister?

17:55.250 --> 17:56.330
Yue.

17:56.330 --> 17:58.370
If you truly want to become a witch,

17:58.370 --> 18:01.910
then you should knock on the doors
of Flora Girls Academy in Malmcester.

18:03.000 --> 18:07.500
Do you think I can be
an amazing witch like you, Eliza-sama?

18:07.500 --> 18:09.040
That's all up to you.

18:10.370 --> 18:13.120
But just maybe...

18:16.040 --> 18:17.080
Yue-san!

18:21.950 --> 18:25.330
I heard about you and my sister.

18:25.330 --> 18:27.790
They never know when to shut up.

18:27.790 --> 18:31.330
I think we're sort of alike, Yue-san.

18:31.330 --> 18:32.700
How?

18:32.700 --> 18:35.910
You and I both want to be
an amazing witch like my sister.

18:38.290 --> 18:43.160
Whenever I was sick,
my sister would sing to make me feel better.

18:43.160 --> 18:46.540
All of your Orchestras did the same.

18:46.540 --> 18:51.250
That's why I also want to be
a witch to bring people happiness.

18:51.250 --> 18:53.830
Those are the kinds of songs I want to sing.

18:53.830 --> 18:56.330
I know this because I saw supernova perform.

18:56.330 --> 18:59.500
I know that you love to sing!

19:00.830 --> 19:05.080
But when you told me
why you were singing earlier,

19:05.080 --> 19:07.000
you seemed to be in so much pain...

19:07.000 --> 19:08.160
Well...

19:09.830 --> 19:13.330
Aren't songs essentially people's feelings?

19:13.330 --> 19:17.910
I felt all your feelings you put into your song.

19:17.910 --> 19:19.620
My feelings?

19:19.620 --> 19:25.660
That's why next time,
I want you to feel my feelings at our Orchestra.

19:25.660 --> 19:28.120
Though I don't know if it'll go as planned...

19:31.660 --> 19:34.660
I seriously can't with you.

19:36.790 --> 19:39.000
Do as you please.

19:39.000 --> 19:40.330
Huh?

19:40.330 --> 19:46.290
If you miserably get expelled,
I'd feel bad for Eliza-sama.

19:55.040 --> 19:56.120
Lynette?

19:57.830 --> 19:59.370
Hello?

20:01.370 --> 20:03.040
Rara-chan...

20:03.040 --> 20:04.660
Wassup?

20:04.660 --> 20:07.410
I could ask the same. This is a rare sight.

20:08.370 --> 20:10.370
I'm just looking something up.

20:10.370 --> 20:12.580
A book on fashion?

20:12.580 --> 20:16.580
Yeah. Making costumes is super hard.

20:16.580 --> 20:19.830
But I want to help those two out
as much as I can.

20:20.410 --> 20:21.660
Help them...

20:23.040 --> 20:24.870
I see.

20:24.870 --> 20:29.500
I was hoping that I could at least
help with some lyrics, but...

20:29.500 --> 20:32.120
Why did you start doing Orchestras, Rara-chan?

20:32.120 --> 20:35.500
I always loved watching them,
and one day, I wanted to do one, too.

20:35.500 --> 20:36.870
That's all it is, really.

20:38.330 --> 20:42.080
You like Ray, too, so I'm sure
you're interested in singing.

20:42.080 --> 20:44.370
Well, yes...

20:44.370 --> 20:46.080
The fact that you're unsure about this means

20:46.080 --> 20:48.870
that there's a part of you
that wants to do this, right?

20:51.120 --> 20:53.910
"Suffering and conflict
are both darkness and light.

20:53.910 --> 20:56.790
Do not fear the path you've chosen. Embrace it!"

20:56.790 --> 20:59.330
Isn't that Chloe-sensei's...

20:59.330 --> 21:01.500
Her famous quote from her days in Ray...

21:06.830 --> 21:09.200
Tiara-san!

21:09.200 --> 21:11.000
What's the matter, Lynette?

21:12.620 --> 21:15.790
I'll give the Orchestra a try!

21:15.790 --> 21:18.790
Really?! Thank you! I'm so happy!

21:19.620 --> 21:21.410
I'm not very confident, though...

21:22.450 --> 21:24.830
I'm not confident at all, either.

21:24.830 --> 21:28.870
That's why we should just do everything we can.

21:29.700 --> 21:30.870
Yes!

21:30.870 --> 21:34.160
All right, then next...

21:34.160 --> 21:38.290
I believe we also need the director's
permission to conduct an Orchestra.

21:38.290 --> 21:39.370
Permission?

21:39.370 --> 21:42.250
Yes, because this also involves
the city's districts, so...

21:42.250 --> 21:45.700
Okay, then I'll go ask
for permission right now!

21:45.700 --> 21:47.580
Thank you!

21:56.000 --> 21:58.250
Come in.

21:58.250 --> 21:59.540
Pardon me.

22:01.250 --> 22:02.790
How may I help you?

22:20.920 --> 22:30.820
mado no soto wa yasashii tsukiakari sotto

22:20.920 --> 22:30.820
Outside the window, the gentle moonlight is shining softly

22:30.820 --> 22:39.520
akari keshite yume no hashi wo watarou

22:30.820 --> 22:39.520
Put out the lights and cross the bridge of dreams

22:39.520 --> 22:44.320
kie soude kienai hikari ga ima

22:39.520 --> 22:44.320
The weakening yet everlasting light is now

22:44.320 --> 22:49.120
mabuta no mukou no sekai ni hirogatta

22:44.320 --> 22:49.120
Spreading out into the world behind my eyelids

22:49.120 --> 22:51.820
ironna omoi ga afurete

22:49.120 --> 22:51.820
Various feelings are overflowing

22:51.820 --> 22:55.570
kirakira mabushiku kagayaiteru

22:51.820 --> 22:55.570
sparklingly and dazzlingly shining

22:55.570 --> 22:58.720
zutto

22:55.570 --> 22:58.720
Forever

22:58.720 --> 23:00.820
It's shining stars

23:00.820 --> 23:05.620
ashita wa donna hi ni naru kana

23:00.820 --> 23:05.620
I wonder what kind of day tomorrow will be

23:05.620 --> 23:10.720
kokoro ni utsushidasu keshiki wa

23:05.620 --> 23:10.720
The scenery that is reflected in my heart

23:10.720 --> 23:15.670
kitai namida yume no zenbu ga kasanatta

23:10.720 --> 23:15.670
Expectations, tears, and dreams, all of it bottled up in my heart

23:15.670 --> 23:19.270
watashi no planetarium

23:15.670 --> 23:19.270
My planetarium

23:19.270 --> 23:20.020
hora

23:19.270 --> 23:25.120
Look, in that star that is shining the brightest

23:20.020 --> 23:25.120
ichiban kagayaiteiru ano hoshi ni

23:25.120 --> 23:29.320
negai kakete oyasumi

23:25.120 --> 23:29.320
A wish is enclosed: "Good night"
